# An empty hand over the napping cat names it; with the sketchbook open over it, nothing is named
# through the panel (Q3-15).
set unlock all
set season summer
set clock day
place cottage @32,30 0
place stump @27,27 0
set camera 29 29 2
fast 150 actor cat sleep
# The stump under where the sketchbook opens (top right).
set camera 28 32 2
wait 2
move actor:cat
wait 2
expect tip The cat
key j
wait 10
expect journal open
move actor:cat
wait 2
expect tip no
quit
